Members of Congress from both parties recently joined us to honor our members’ service, and wish the Coast Guard an early happy birthday. This included recognition of the air crew from Coast Guard MH-65E helicopter 6553, who were instrumental in conducting 169 rescues during the response to devastating flooding in Central Texas in early July. We are deeply grateful for bipartisan Congressional support and for the American people’s trust.

Whether securing our 31,000 miles of maritime borders, leading the nation’s maritime drug interdiction efforts, or rushing into chaos as America’s maritime first responder, the Coast Guard is always ready to protect and serve our nation. Thank you for standing with us! #USCG #AlwaysReady
@DHSgov

