Part II: Our legacy continues. Through Force Design 2028 – our largest structural and strategic overhaul since World War II – we are transforming into a more agile, capable, and responsive fighting force prepared to meet national needs. We are delivering on historic investment in the Coast Guard by modernizing our assets, capabilities, and infrastructure. 

View this transformation timeline to see how the Coast Guard has evolved. What comes next? Check back in tomorrow to learn more about our execution plan for Force Design 2028.  #USCG #ForceDesign2028
@DHSgov @Sec_Noem

