tweets.text:
Coast Guard Cutter Healy recently kicked off its annual Arctic deployment. The crew, alongside agency partners, is tackling the icy waters to study sea ice and ocean movement. This vital research boosts our understanding of the Arctic, reinforcing our presence in this growing zone of strategic global competition.

Through historic investment in @USCG, we are building a national fleet of icebreakers to provide the global reach and capability necessary to project U.S. presence and influence, conduct Coast Guard missions in the high latitudes, and advance national interests in the polar regions.

Dive into Healy’s thrilling journey!
#uscg #arctic
@USCGPACAREA 
@USCGArctic 
@cgchealy

